tory":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Johnston County runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. This year so far, March to April 2026 came in at 36% of normal on the middle of the grids. In 2025 November to December came in at 61%, and grid 19108 had its driest year in 2007 at 64% of normal.</p>"}
